# Copy to web/.env (git-ignored) on the machine that runs the page and the MCP server; run.sh and compose read it.
# Both addresses default to 127.0.0.1, which no other device can reach. Set one address of this machine, never 0.0.0.0.
# 192.0.2.10 is a documentation address (RFC 5737): replace it.
# SFA_BIND=192.0.2.10
# SFA_MCP_BIND=192.0.2.10
